abstract: >
  BCRA (Bio-Connectome Recurrent Architecture) is a recurrent artificial
  intelligence architecture constructed from a biological connectome.
  BCRA v1 investigates whether a large real biological connectivity graph
  can function as a recurrent computational substrate and how topology
  and recurrent dynamics influence temporal computation. BCRA v1.0.0
  defines two validated operating regimes: BCRA-Native and
  BCRA-Relaxed10.
